{
  "_help": [
    "Layout of the purchase-entry form in the Invoice Tester. Edit labels, order or sources here; reload the page.",
    "key: the name used in Export CSV/JSON. label: what the form shows.",
    "source: where the extracted value comes from: invoice.<field> (core fields), details.<field> (purchase-entry details),",
    "  or null for a field you fill in yourself (not printed on invoices). formula: computed in the page (marked f).",
    "type: text (default), date, number. wide: spans the whole row. hint: small text under the field.",
    "tabs: the tabs of the form and the sections each shows. fill: the column gets an 'all' box that sets every line. fx: marked f (a value formulas use)."
  ],
